---
import { buildContentData } from "../../data/buildContent";
import HowToBuildCard from "./HowToBuildCard.astro";
---

<section id="how-i-build" class="w-full py-16 px-4 bg-secondary">
	<div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
		<!-- Header -->
		<h2
			class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight uppercase"
		>
			How I build content that
			<span class="relative inline-block font-serif italic text-alert-neutral">
				converts
				<svg
					class="absolute left-[-0.03em] bottom-[-0.28em] h-[0.55em] w-[1.08em] min-w-full overflow-visible"
					viewBox="0 0 260 32"
					fill="none"
					xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
					aria-hidden="true"
				>
					<path
						d="M6 20
         C48 8, 98 8, 148 10
         C125 13, 106 17, 98 22
         C135 14, 190 12, 254 14"
						stroke="currentColor"
						stroke-width="5"
						stroke-linecap="round"
						stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
				</svg>
			</span>
		</h2>
		<p class="mt-10 text-xl max-w-5xl mx-auto text-muted text-center">
			It's easy to make something look good. It's much harder to make it
			convert. That's why I've spent the last year not just creating “fun”
			videos, but building a strategic UGC approach designed to drive real
			results. Every piece I create follows a framework rooted in human
			psychology and storytelling, so your brand doesn't just get views-<span
				class="text-tertiary font-bold">it gets sales</span
			>
		</p>

		<!-- Cards -->
		<HowToBuildCard cards={buildContentData} />

		<!-- Bottom Statement -->
		<div
			class="mt-16 bg-white rounded-xl px-6 py-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 shadow-sm"
		>
			<p class="text-sm text-neutral-700">
				❤️ This isn't random content. It's intentional content that
				<span class="text-red-400 font-medium">converts.</span>
			</p>

			<p class="text-sm text-neutral-700">
				📈 More than views. Real impact.
				<span class="text-red-400 font-medium">Real sales.</span>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
